  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vanuatu Education Support Program Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This program supports the Ministry of Education and Training to improve education access, quality and management in the early childhood and primary education sector. This is through targeted support for Ministry&#x2019;s strategic planning and implementation of activities. The program also includes a Direct Funding Arrangement that provides the Ministry with funds for cyclone recovery infrastructure, school fee relief and other ad hoc needs. The program is supporting equal access for boys and girls and inclusive education policies and implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
